WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.450
Healing. It's hard, right?

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.570
And you know why it's hard?

3
00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:06.690
Because healing takes time.

4
00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:10.690
And it's one of those things that
we just sort of wish it could

5
00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:14.370
be over, right? But you've seen
it in your physical body, right?

6
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.290
You've sustained an injury.

7
00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:17.970
You've gotten a cut
or a scrape, right?

8
00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.850
And you've had to go
through a process.

9
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:25.170
And that process of healing,
the time that it takes, is often

10
00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:28.600
dependent on how severe the wound.

11
00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:32.820
And so what if today you were
just patient in the same way with

12
00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:33.810
your soul?

13
00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:36.820
And maybe without
even realizing it,

14
00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:39.930
God's already doing
a healing work.

15
00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:42.570
And today you're just going
to get to sit into that and be

16
00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:46.650
grateful. Lord, thank you
for your healing, God.

17
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:49.690
Thank you that the sun of
righteousness, that you, Jesus, rise

18
00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:52.410
and that you have
healing in your wings.

19
00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:56.570
And Lord, we just call on the
power of that healing today, God.

20
00:00:56.620 --> 00:01:01.610
Just do a true cleansing
work in our souls,

21
00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:04.560
Lord, and help us to be patient

22
00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:08.790
with the process, realizing it's
in those moments that we can

23
00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:10.390
draw closer to you.

24
00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:12.320
In Jesus' name, amen.

